Category: <%= category.label %>

Card:
Title: <%= card.title %>
Description: <%= card.description.presence&.truncate(description_limit) || "none" %>
Seller attributes: <%= card.seller_text.presence || "none" %>

Requested attributes:
<%= attributes.map { |attribute| "- #{attribute.name} (#{attribute.label})#{": #{hints[attribute.name]}" if hints[attribute.name]}" }.join("\n") %>
